{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1384054-dr-fredrickstan-s-treatise-on-the-standard-model-unified-cofd-cosmology","id":1384054,"title":"Dr. Fredrickstan's Treatise on the Standard Model [Unified CofD Cosmology]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-26T16:38:38-07:00","id":1384054,"title":"Dr. Fredrickstan's Treatise on the Standard Model [Unified CofD Cosmology]","content":"<b>Rant Begins</b><br /> <br /> So I originally planned to publish it as my first STV title, but my sister keeps postponing her agreed role of doing the art and layout (she promised she would do so with the current STV Sprint, and she better do so this time), but as I have planned do offer it as Pay What You Want at best I have decided that it is better to present it here than let it rot in my google drive (and in the unlikely case my sister would decide to do the layout for this piece, it would still be a PWYW, so no drastic consequences), so at the very least some people could enjoy reading it, as I have wrote some notes about a unified CofD cosmology before, and some people were interested in it, so...<br /> <br /> <b>Rant Ends</b><br /> <br /> <i>The structure of the world has always been a mystery. Only in the last centuries we have started getting close to the truth of how the universe operate, and even now we still struggle at certain foundational problems. However, those understandings apply only to our own universe- but other, stranger worlds exists beside this one. From the predatory wilds of Hisil to the hungry depths of the Underworld, from the bright light of the Empyrean to the burning flames of Inferno, the way that those worlds are intertwined with each other and structured upon one another has been a mystery which baffled even the wisest mages. Is there any order in the chaos? Or perhaps the multiverse is indeed just a collection of mad creations with no logic behind it? Join Dr. Fredrickstan as he delves into the structure of the so called Standard Model, and details his own research, experience and notes, and his attempt to bring a clear to the question which has haunted the occult world since the beginning of time- is the truth out there? And if so, do we want to find it?<br /> <br /> Read on your own responsibility to find out.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-EKg4FcdvzXT5u9aN6X87il7N_FK2JVzAXCLRBV50-4/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Dr. Fredrickstan's Treatise on the Standard Model</a> <br /> <br /> Hope you'll like it, and please tell me what you think about it! (fair warning, it is a bit long. Again, it was planned as an STV title, after all :P )","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-26T17:21:08-07:00","id":1384060,"title":"","content":"I haven't had the time to read it yet (got my own writing to finish), but I know the quality of your work so...<br /> <br /> Please don't make it PWYW.<br /> <br /> Obviously it is your choice, but you've got over 22K of awesome worldbuilding and plot hooks. That time and effort has value. Any of us who want to read it for free can do so here, but if you're tossing it into the great wide open with art and layout, you deserve to be compensated.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-26T17:55:55-07:00","id":1384064,"title":"","content":"Bloody hell! That's fascinating.<br /> So the Hedge and Arcadia are close to unclassifiable in your cosmology?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T03:03:41-07:00","id":1384138,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1384054-dr-fredrickstan-s-treatise-on-the-standard-model-unified-cofd-cosmology?p=1384060#post1384060\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I haven't had the time to read it yet (got my own writing to finish), but I know the quality of your work so...<br /> <br /> Please don't make it PWYW.<br /> <br /> Obviously it is your choice, but you've got over 22K of awesome worldbuilding and plot hooks. That time and effort has value. Any of us who want to read it for free can do so here, but if you're tossing it into the great wide open with art and layout, you deserve to be compensated.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you for your compliments <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> the main reason I wanted to do it PWYW was because it didn't felt right to charge people for &quot;just&quot; setting material, and probably because of lack of trust in the quality of my work- but again, let's first wait for my sister to finally do the art, which may take awhile :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T03:07:51-07:00","id":1384140,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1384054-dr-fredrickstan-s-treatise-on-the-standard-model-unified-cofd-cosmology?p=1384064#post1384064\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bloody hell! That's fascinating.<br /> So the Hedge and Arcadia are close to unclassifiable in your cosmology?</div> </div> </div> </div>More or less- the Hedge is everywhere in the cosmology. Arcadia is nowhere. You could access the Hedge through any layer of reality and it is found in any layer of reality, but Arcadia is just outside of the Standard Model","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T03:48:00-07:00","id":1384153,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1384054-dr-fredrickstan-s-treatise-on-the-standard-model-unified-cofd-cosmology?p=1384140#post1384140\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You could access the Hedge through any layer of reality and it is found in any layer of reality,</div> </div> </div> </div>Isn't this true for almost all the different realms (barring Lower Depths and mage's non-realms)? The &quot;material&quot; contains portals to basically all places, the Shadow is just a mirror of the material in this regard, the Astral is available anywhere there are minds on top of there being Synesi and other weird portals that binds specific places in the Astral with different realms, and Avernian Gates are present in most realms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T04:35:25-07:00","id":1384164,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1384054-dr-fredrickstan-s-treatise-on-the-standard-model-unified-cofd-cosmology?p=1384153#post1384153\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Isn't this true for almost all the different realms (barring Lower Depths and mage's non-realms)? The &quot;material&quot; contains portals to basically all places, the Shadow is just a mirror of the material in this regard, the Astral is available anywhere there are minds on top of there being Synesi and other weird portals that binds specific places in the Astral with different realms, and Avernian Gates are present in most realms.</div> </div> </div> </div>I meant metaphysically speaking- in this cosmology, the Hedge is everywhere, and is metaphysically a part of every layer. As I wrote in the document, the concepts of &quot;up&quot; and &quot;down&quot;, as well as how those realms come in contact with each other, is just a mental construction meant to make things clearer for the reader. Just like how the &quot;colours&quot; of quarks do not actually mean anything related to an actual colour, so does &quot;up&quot; and &quot;down&quot; in relation to cosmology. The Hedge, however, is indeed EVERYWHERE. It is as Supernal as it is Abyssal as it is Fallen as it is a Lower Depth. <br /> <br /> So yeah, the Hedge is still a big &quot;unknown&quot; even in this cosmology (which is written from an IC point of view, so an unreliable narrator is still an issue- one which the writer is well aware of, as written in the text).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T14:01:02-07:00","id":1387072,"title":"","content":"Great! Would love to see it illustrated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T15:35:26-07:00","id":1387097,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Deinos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1384054-dr-fredrickstan-s-treatise-on-the-standard-model-unified-cofd-cosmology?p=1387072#post1387072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Great! Would love to see it illustrated.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! I hope that I'll manage to convince my sister to illustrate it one day :P<br /> <br /> On a related note, how many of you would be interested in seeing other such &quot;Treatises&quot; which go into a deeper focus about certain aspects of the CofD? (like, a focused Treatise about vampires, werewolves, mages, etc). I think about writing them, but I want to make sure people woul read them beforehand :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T22:59:32-07:00","id":1388239,"title":"","content":"Read about 40% so far, but it's been a long day and eyes are tired. A couple of minor notes:<br /> <br /> - I love the concept of the Ice. Does it come from somewhere I'm unaware of, or did you make that up?<br /> - I am deeply disappointed thate Note 3 doesn't reference the Law of Fives from the Principia Discordia.<br /> - Speaking of fives, also surprised that you didn't mention the theory that gravity's weirdness is because it &quot;crosses dimensions&quot; via the hypothetical &quot;graviton&quot; particle. In an otherworlds-heavy cosmology like CofD's, it seems like it'd be a good fit.<br /> <br /> I like it overall, and agree it 'd be worth paying for. It beggars my belief that an actual IC human could compile enough data to write all this, but if I were to use this in a game, I'd honestly probably corrupt it somehow anyways. Like, only make half a page available as a clue or something, dunno.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I call the Integrity-analogue the &quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822559-trying-to-understand-the-morality-system?p=825008#post825008\" target=\"_blank\">subjective stat</a>&quot;.<br /> An explanation how to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/913221-using-social-manuevering\" target=\"_blank\">use Social Manuevering</a>.<br /> Guanxi Explanations: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=787824#post787824\" target=\"_blank\">1</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=788173#post788173\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/833863-mages-and-trading-favors?p=834531#post834531\" target=\"_blank\">3</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T03:52:44-07:00","id":1388292,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Errol216</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1384054-dr-fredrickstan-s-treatise-on-the-standard-model-unified-cofd-cosmology?p=1388239#post1388239\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> - I love the concept of the Ice. Does it come from somewhere I'm unaware of, or did you make that up?</div> </div> </div> </div>it is an homebrew material I wrote as Promethean Antagonist. You can find that presentation in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/947179-the-awful-ice-setting-material\">here</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> - I am deeply disappointed thate Note 3 doesn't reference the Law of Fives from the Principia Discordia.<br /> - Speaking of fives, also surprised that you didn't mention the theory that gravity's weirdness is because it &quot;crosses dimensions&quot; via the hypothetical &quot;graviton&quot; particle. In an otherworlds-heavy cosmology like CofD's, it seems like it'd be a good fit. </div> </div> </div>Well, I am yet to be all knowing, but it is always good to learn something new! (like, I don't really know much about Discordianism other than it exists, or connections between gravitons and the number five. I'll look those up, thanks)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I like it overall, and agree it 'd be worth paying for. It beggars my belief that an actual IC human could compile enough data to write all this, but if I were to use this in a game, I'd honestly probably corrupt it somehow anyways. Like, only make half a page available as a clue or something, dunno. </div> </div> </div>one of the reasons to make the narrator an IC mortal was mainly to make that Treatise very, very, <i>very</i> unreliable. As it is presented as a document which characters may stumble upon in game, it would mean that the characters are as likely to say &quot;well, that's just a crazy mortal.. right?&quot;. Characters who find that document would doubt both that document and their world view, while it is an excuse for STs who use that cosmology to take parts of it and ignore the rest, giving a framework without forcing anyone to feel obligated to follow through it. In short, it is a mortal narrator in order to discredit the Treatise, and make people wonder that if it is true, then how the hell he actually managed to write all of it and live? And yeah, I can totally see a Chronicle based around gathering shards of that document.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I'm glad to hear you liked what you read so far!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-20T17:57:50-07:00","id":1390426,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1384054-dr-fredrickstan-s-treatise-on-the-standard-model-unified-cofd-cosmology?p=1388292#post1388292\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">it is an homebrew material I wrote as Promethean Antagonist. You can find that presentation in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/947179-the-awful-ice-setting-material\">here</a></div> </div> </div> </div>I'll add it to my reading list.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1384054-dr-fredrickstan-s-treatise-on-the-standard-model-unified-cofd-cosmology?p=1388292#post1388292\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, I am yet to be all knowing, but it is always good to learn something new! (like, I don't really know much about Discordianism other than it exists, or connections between gravitons and the number five. I'll look those up, thanks)</div> </div> </div> </div>Discordianism is mostly a satirical religion, so that line item was meant more as a joke than a criticism. The Law of Fives is a mockery of numerology's habit of finding meaning out of coincidence: i.e., &quot;5 shows up everywhere! It must be significant!&quot;<br /> <br /> The graviton bit is an obscure-ish bit of string theory, and it manages to jump the curb from &quot;theoretical physics many smart people are enthusiastic about the possibility of being correct&quot; to &quot;speculative physics that make smart people hesitate&quot;. The idea is that some math works out such that gravity operates on the 5th dimension of space time, which is a somewhat reasonable conclusion to draw from the spacetime continuum curving due to gravity's influence. Said 5th dimension may help explain black holes as singularities, for instance, in that what goes in actually <i>is</i> going somewhere, and also may help unify the four fundamental forces in physics. (Note that, at this point in time, string theory seems to be losing proponents. \u00af\\_(\u30c4)_/\u00af)<br /> <br /> Anyways, I'm not an expert either, but it felt like the kind of nigh-fictional sounds-smart-but-is-badly-unconfirmed theory your researcher would be conversant in and would've happily stuffed into the treatise. (It's also the kind of thing that would help discredit him, in my opinion, so maybe it's also better that you didn't put it in? Dunno.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I call the Integrity-analogue the &quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822559-trying-to-understand-the-morality-system?p=825008#post825008\" target=\"_blank\">subjective stat</a>&quot;.<br /> An explanation how to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/913221-using-social-manuevering\" target=\"_blank\">use Social Manuevering</a>.<br /> Guanxi Explanations: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=787824#post787824\" target=\"_blank\">1</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=788173#post788173\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/833863-mages-and-trading-favors?p=834531#post834531\" target=\"_blank\">3</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-21T04:43:52-07:00","id":1390530,"title":"","content":"Well, that explains the graviton- Dr. Fredrickstan (such as myself) is not a strong theory fan. Having a fancy mathematics which you can't solve and pretty predictions you can't test because technology is not advanced enough is a bit problematic, in his opinion :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}